Description: P2P LAN Messenger with AI Features
 Kylin Messenger is a modern peer-to-peer local area network messenger
 application designed for Rockchip development boards and Kylin OS.
 .
 Features:
  * Serverless P2P communication
  * Automatic user discovery via UDP broadcast
  * Reliable TCP messaging and file transfer
  * NPU-accelerated AI features:
    - AI chat assistant
    - Intelligent image tagging
    - Smart reply suggestions
    - Content filtering
  * Modern Qt6 interface
  * Built-in screenshot tool
  * Emoji support
  * System tray integration
 .
 This package provides the main application executable and resources.
